# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEXUS SOVEREIGN ENGINE — .gitignore
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Principle of Least Privilege:
# Only the public application codebase, schemas, and templates are tracked.
# All client PII, lead pipelines, commercial ledgers, private keys, wallet
# keystores, internal logs, and environment secrets are strictly excluded.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─── 1. Environment Secrets & API Credentials (NEVER COMMIT) ─────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
*.key
*.pem
*.cert
*.crt
*.pfx
*.p12
*.token
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
credentials*.json
client_secret*.json
service_account*.json
firebase-adminsdk*.json
email_accounts.json
.vercel
.open-wa/

# ─── 2. Financial, Customer & Commercial Ledgers (Client Data Privacy) ──────
